<title>GERMANY: LUGE-WOMEN'S WORLD CUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>LUGE-WOMEN'S WORLD CUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>WINTERBERG, Germany 1997-02-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading results of a women's singles World Cup luge event after two runs on Saturday:</p>
<p> 1. Sylke Otto (Germany)     1 minute 21.800 seconds</p>
<p>(40.870/40.930)</p>
<p> 2. Andrea Tagwerker (Austria)	1:21.914 (41.034/40.880)</p>
<p> 3. Jana Bode (Germany)		 1:21.979 (41.052/40.927)</p>
<p> 4. Angelika Neuner (Austria)	 1:21.991 (41.086/40.905)</p>
<p> 5. Susi Erdmann (Germany)	    1:22.172 (41.193/40.979)</p>
<p> 6. Natalie Obkircher (Italy)	 1:22.386 (41.204/41.182)</p>
<p>Leading World Cup standings:</p>
<p> 1. Tagwerker 183 points</p>
<p> 2. Kraushaar 173</p>
<p> 3. Neuner    172</p>
<p> 4. Bode	168</p>
<p> 5. Erdmann   165</p>
<p> 6. Myler     148</p>
